cargo-c 0.10.19: QNX Neutrino (target_os "nto") as an ELF/.so target.

librsvg 2.60 builds its C library with cargo-c (`cargo cbuild`). cargo-c
knows the library file names, the library kind and the soname option per
operating system and stopped on the QNX targets with "The target nto-nto80
is not supported yet". QNX shared libraries are ELF with a DT_SONAME like
Linux': "nto" joins the Linux/BSD group in the three places (file names,
install kind, -Wl,-soname). Applied to cargo-c 0.10.19+cargo-0.93.0, the
newest release whose rust-version (1.90) ports/rust meets, built for the
build machine (cargo install --path, --locked).

diff -ru a/src/build_targets.rs b/src/build_targets.rs
--- a/src/build_targets.rs	2006-07-24 10:21:28.000000000 +0900
+++ b/src/build_targets.rs	2026-11-25 20:42:37.347956092 +0900
@@ -165,7 +165,7 @@
